{"id":18897,"date":"2025-07-23T21:34:59","date_gmt":"2025-07-23T21:34:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18897"},"modified":"2025-07-23T21:34:59","modified_gmt":"2025-07-23T21:34:59","slug":"john-michaels","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/john-michaels\/","title":{"rendered":"John Michaels"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-18896\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/john-michael.jpg\" alt=\"A man with a beard and tattoos, wearing a red Nike polo shirt with a logo on the chest, stands against a plain white background, smiling at the camera\u2014perfectly capturing the approachable vibe of professional DJs for event entertainment.\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/>John Michaels | DJ, Sports Broadcaster, Hype Machine<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Hailing from Miami, Florida,\u00a0<strong>John Michaels<\/strong>\u00a0brings the heat\u2014both on the mic and behind the decks. A professional DJ since 2004, John\u2019s love for music and passion for getting people moving launched a career that now spans high-energy club nights, unforgettable corporate parties, and electrifying sports watch events.<\/p>\n<p>When he\u2019s not rocking the turntables, you can catch John on the airwaves at\u00a0<strong>680 The Fan<\/strong>, Atlanta\u2019s premier sports radio station, where he brings insider energy and sharp commentary to coverage of the\u00a0<strong>Braves, Falcons, Hawks, Georgia Tech<\/strong>, and more. His background in sports broadcasting means he knows how to hype a crowd, read a room, and keep the energy flowing from the first beat to the last play.<\/p>\n<p>In his headphones? It\u2019s a mix of\u00a0<strong>Rick Ross, Kendrick Lamar, Drake<\/strong>, and a splash of rock to keep things fresh and unpredictable. His sets are just as versatile\u2014seamlessly blending hip-hop, pop, rock, and throwbacks to keep every crowd on their feet.<\/p>\n<p>John is a proud husband and father of three, and in his downtime, he lives and breathes sports\u2014coaching\u00a0<strong>AAU basketball<\/strong>\u00a0and staying active in the community. Whether it\u2019s a downtown rooftop, a corporate celebration, or a jam-packed watch party, John brings a\u00a0<strong>high-energy, professional approach<\/strong>\u00a0with the music knowledge and charisma to match.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Get ready for a DJ who doesn&#8217;t just play music\u2014he creates moments.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>John Michaels | DJ, Sports Broadcaster, Hype Machine Hailing from Miami, Florida,\u00a0John Michaels\u00a0brings the heat\u2014both on the mic and behind the decks. A professional DJ since 2004, John\u2019s love for music and passion for getting people moving launched a career that now spans high-energy club nights, unforgettable corporate parties, and electrifying sports watch events. When&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18897","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>John Michaels - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/john-michaels\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"John Michaels\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"John Michaels | DJ, Sports Broadcaster, Hype Machine Hailing from Miami, Florida,\u00a0John Michaels\u00a0brings the hea